<view class="page-container">
  <empty-state
    wx:if="{{records.length === 0}}"
    title="还没有记录"
    description="测算后会保存在这台设备，方便随时回顾和修改。"
    actionText="开始测算"
    bind:action="onStartAssessment"
  />

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="row-between header-bar">
      <text class="secondary-text">最近保存 {{records.length}} / 20 份</text>
      <text class="clear-all-link" bindtap="onClearAll">清空全部</text>
    </view>

    <view class="card record-card" wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id">
      <view data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onOpenReport">
        <view class="row-between">
          <text class="record-meta">{{item.metaText}}</text>
          <text class="source-text">{{item.timeText}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="record-headline">{{item.headline}}</view>
        <view class="source-text">{{item.versionText}}</view>
      </view>

      <view class="record-actions">
        <text class="open-link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onOpenReport">查看原报告</text>
        <text class="delete-link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onDeleteOne">删除</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view class="card footer-card section-gap">
    <view class="source-text">
      记录保存在这台设备，无需登录也不做云端同步；更换设备或清理微信缓存后可能无法找回。
    </view>
    <view class="about-link" bindtap="onGoAbout">方法说明、隐私与反馈 ›</view>
  </view>
</view>
